		<r3d:repositoryName language="eng">QualiBi</r3d:repositoryName>
				<r3d:additionalName language="eng">Data for Qualitative Educational Research</r3d:additionalName>
				<r3d:additionalName language="deu">Daten der qualitativen Bildungsforschung</r3d:additionalName>
				<r3d:repositoryUrl>https://qualibi.net</r3d:repositoryUrl>
				<r3d:description language="eng">QualiBi sees itself as a repository and platform for data in qualitative educational research. These data are documented, archived, and made available for scientific reuse upon request. Educational research primarily refers to research in the field of education in all its thematic and methodological diversity, but also includes studies from related disciplines that focus on educational processes across all stages of life or their underlying conditions. QualiBi aims to create an infrastructure that, with maximum involvement from the academic community, is specifically tailored to the needs of qualitative educational research. By doing so, it seeks to promote the sustainable management of research data and enable collaborative research based on a shared data foundation.</r3d:description>
